40 * 20 = 800 Rafaela received $800. Julieta received 10% less than Rafaela, so Julieta received 800 - (800 * 0.10) = 800 - 80 = $720. Together, they received $800 + $720 = $1520. \boxed{1520}
Rafaela received $20 tip from 40 customers. So, Rafaela received 40 * $20 = $800. Julieta received 10% less than Rafaela, so she received 10% less of $800. 10% of $800 is $800 * 0.10 = $80. So, Julieta received $800 - $80 = $720. Together, Julieta and Rafaela received $720 + $800 = $1520.
\boxed{1520}

